    <section style="margin-bottom:40px">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:800; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:12px; border-bottom:2px solid var(--line); padding-bottom:8px">1. Our Mission</h2>
      <p style="line-height:1.7; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:14px">
        ClipSAT provides comprehensive, curriculum-aligned mathematics across 31 tracks for students preparing for Saudi national examinations (GAT Qudrat, SAAT Tahsili, English GAT/SAAT) and international tracks (Digital SAT, ACT I &amp; II, EST I &amp; II, AP Calculus AB/BC, AP Precalculus, AP Statistics, Cambridge IGCSE 0580, Edexcel 4MA1, Additional Math 0606, AS/A-Level 9709, IB Mathematics AA SL/HL, and Contest/Olympiad Math), as well as higher-level university mathematics (Linear Algebra, Multivariable Calculus, Differential Equations, and Math for AI &amp; Data Science).
      </p>
      <p style="line-height:1.7; color:var(--text)">
        Our guiding philosophy is that students learn mathematics best when they interact with visual representations, manipulate equations dynamically, understand the "why" through formal proofs, and practice deliberate problem-solving with immediate feedback.
      </p>
    </section>

