      <div style="background:var(--panel, #fff); border:1.5px solid var(--line); border-left:4px solid var(--indigo); border-radius:10px; padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:16px">
        <strong style="color:var(--text); font-size:.98rem; display:block; margin-bottom:6px">An Independent Educator Project</strong>
        <p style="margin:0; font-size:.92rem; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.6">
          ClipSAT is an independent educational endeavor. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or funded by any testing organization (such as College Board, Cambridge Assessment, or Qiyas/ETEC), venture capital firm, or corporate sponsor.
        </p>
      </div>
      <p style="line-height:1.7; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:14px">
        <strong>How we fund the project:</strong>
      </p>
      <ul style="padding-left:20px; line-height:1.7; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:16px">
        <li><strong>Core Content Free Floor:</strong> All 31 curriculum tracks, worked proofs, interactive visualizers, formula sheets, and question banks are 100% free of charge for students worldwide.</li>
        <li><strong>ClipSAT Plus:</strong> An optional convenience subscription (75 SAR/year or 15 SAR/month) that unlocks cloud synchronization across devices, automated SM-2 spaced repetition, and extended AI tutor access.</li>
        <li><strong>Voluntary Community Contributions:</strong> Modest donations via PayPal from grateful students, alumni, and parents who wish to help cover server and hosting costs.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom:40px">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:800; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:12px; border-bottom:2px solid var(--line); padding-bottom:8px">4. Content Review &amp; Quality Process</h2>
      <p style="line-height:1.7; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:12px">
        Educational integrity is our top priority. Our verification pipeline guarantees high standards:
      </p>
      <ul style="padding-left:20px; line-height:1.7; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:16px">
        <li><strong>Syllabus Alignment:</strong> Each curriculum track is benchmarked directly against official specifications (e.g., Cambridge MF19 &amp; 0580 syllabi, College Board AP course descriptions, Qiyas test frameworks).</li>
        <li><strong>Human Oversight on AI-Assisted Content:</strong> Where AI tools assist in question generation or format conversion, every question, choice set, and solution is reviewed against rubric standards and verified for mathematical correctness before release.</li>
        <li><strong>Continuous Correction Loop:</strong> If a student or educator discovers an erratum or ambiguous wording, our team reviews and corrects the item immediately.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

